    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d802">

                <pb facs="1094" n="1084" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg1084"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/5–445</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the United Kingdom Representative on the
                        European Advisory Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Strang</hi>)<anchor n="6" xml:id="d802-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">E.A.C. (45) 47</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1945-05-02">2 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >May</hi>, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Representation of Foreign Countries in Germany After
                        Surrender</hi>
                </p>
                <p>I circulate to my colleagues, for consideration by the European Advisory
                    Commission, a memorandum making proposals for the representation of foreign
                    countries in Germany after surrender. I hope the Commission will be able to give
                    early consideration to these proposals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W[<hi rendition="#small-caps">illiam</hi>] S[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >trang</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi>, 30 April, [<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >2 May?</hi>] 1945.</p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d802-a1.xml" xpointer="d802-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d802-f1" n="6" type="source" xml:id="d802-f1-content">
                <p>Copy transmitted to the Department in despatch 22877, May 4, from London;
